  - m_Id: 107575889920
    m_Localized: "The ship\u2019s stabilizing, but thanks to your glorious crash
      landing, the mechanics are toast\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 110625148928
    m_Localized: "My scans show there are still some Outposts you haven\u2019t wrecked
      yet. I\u2019ve marked them on your map. You\u2019ll probably find what we need
      there \u2014 bring it back here."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 114198695936
    m_Localized: "A box containing replacement parts should be here. Search the buildings
      once you\u2019ve dealt with the locals."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
